<title>USA: Brilliance China sets semi-annual div.</title>
<headline>Brilliance China sets semi-annual div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brilliance China Automotive Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that it would switch to a semi-annual from a quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the change would take effect with the next dividend payable on October 31 to shareholders of record on October 10.</p>
<p>The company's directors voted at a meeting on Monday to set the dividend at $0.04 a share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
